{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 36, :comments ["<b>Is it thus.</b> Like אמת, and so too \"Is it thus that you are my brother\" (Genesis 29:15)." "<b>He called.</b> The one who calls his name Jacob." "<b>And he deceived me.</b> Like מרמה, and so too \"with subtlety\" (II Kings 10:19). It is also possible that it is from the root of \"devious the heart\" (Jeremiah 17:9), and the devious is the opposite of the straight." "<b>You reserved for me.</b> You left for me what is with you, and it is from the root of \"and I will reserve of the spirit\" (Numbers 11:17)."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:46:03.917629125Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}